# Full-bleed hero motion (approved)

Use this Ken Burns on home, Web Design, SEO / AEO, and any future similar full-bleed media heroes. Do not change without asking.

```css
.hero-media img,
.page-hero-media .hero-media img {
  transform: scale3d(1.16, 1.16, 1);
  animation: heroKenBurns 12s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.61, 0.36, 1) forwards;
  will-change: transform;
  backface-visibility: hidden;
}

@keyframes heroKenBurns {
  from {
    transform: scale3d(1.2, 1.2, 1) translate3d(1.5%, 0.5%, 0);
  }
  to {
    transform: scale3d(1, 1, 1) translate3d(0, 0, 0);
  }
}
```

- **12s**, ease `cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.61, 0.36, 1)`
- Scale **1.2 → 1** with light pan `translate3d(1.5%, 0.5%, 0)`
- Markup: `.hero` + `.hero-media` / `.page-hero-media` as on home / web-design / seo
- Mobile/tablet may only tweak `object-position` / `transform-origin` for framing (laptop, phone, etc.)
